    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan sends permanence Gu into treasure yellow heaven. The Gu belonged to Heavenly Court at first. After Star Constellation Immortal Venerable receives it, she inspects it, and Fang Yuan offers further Immortal Gu if she attacks Longevity Heaven or any of the Huang Jin tribes.",
