          "fac_huang_jin_bloodline"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s modification plan, permanence Gu has a huge role together with star thought Gu and star eyes Gu, which is why she requests Fang Yuan to provide them.",
